  itemDescription: Water Management & Treatment Technologies Institute  This institute
    focuses on the management, treatment, and reuse of water. Its mission is to develop
    technologies for wastewater treatment, water recycling, and efficient water management
    systems. Key research areas include advanced filtration, biological treatment
    of sewage, industrial wastewater remediation, and smart water-grid management
    (sensors and IoT for leak detection and usage optimization). The institute aims
    to maximize the use of every drop of water through recycling and efficient distribution,
    critical for a water-scarce country like Saudi Arabia
